Subject: [PATCH 2/6] drm/panel-edp: add BOE NE160QDM-NX4 (0x0d25)

Add the 16" 2560x1600 (60/144 Hz) LCD panel of the ASUS Vivobook S16
S3607QA. Without the entry the driver warns "Unknown panel BOE 0x0d25,
using conservative timings".

The delays were not derived from the ACPI tables or the EDID: the ACPI
panel configuration of this laptop is a generic one
("Panel_Generic_Amoled", backlight PWM settings only) without
power-sequencing data, and no datasheet is available. delay_200_500_e80
was chosen because other BOE NE1xx panels in this file use it; the panel
has worked reliably with it across many cold boots on v7.3.3 and
next-20261112.

